183 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 64 0 R
/E (Although the two half adders are written using different coding styles, they describe the same Boolean logic. The assign version directly specifies the Boolean equations, while the always_comb version uses procedural if-else statements to produce the same outputs. During synthesis, the synthesis tool analyzes the logic rather than the coding style. Since both modules implement the same truth table, they are synthesized into the same hardware consisting of one XOR gate for the sum output and one AND gate for the carry output.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
